      "id": 4350302,
      "name": "[Blueprint][Hoshimi Miyabi] Frost Inferno - Lv.50",
      "desc": "This blueprint can be used to unlock the crafting of Hoshimi Miyabi's exclusive Tactical Prism at the Smart Workshop. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\nItem Effect: After Hoshimi Miyabi executes a Powerful Slash on an enemy, she immediately restores 1 Fallen Frost point.\nEnemies afflicted with <color=#FFFFFF>Icefire</color> <color=#2BAD00>take <color=#98EFF0>Frost DMG</color> equal to 260% of Hoshimi Miyabi's ATK per second</color>. Upon triggering <color=#FFFFFF>Frostburn - Break</color>, Hoshimi Miyabi can bypass the restrictions of <color=#FFFFFF>Frostburn</color> and <color=#2BAD00>immediately reapply <color=#FFFFFF>Icefire</color> to enemies</color>.",
